	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 2nd level, you begin expanding your mystical repertoire to gain magical benefits which are not cantrip-related. These tricks of the trade may not be the defining trait of a warcaster, but they often help both on and off the battlefield. You gain two Legerdemains at 2nd level and additional Legerdemains as shown on the warcaster table.</p><p>Whenever you gain a new Legerdemain, you may also choose to replace a legerdemain you already know with a new one so long as you meet any requirements such as level.</p><p>The list of available Legerdemains can be found at the end of the warcaster class entry.</p><p>[[/browser tab=feature label=\"Legerdemain\" selections='{\"classes\":{\"inclusive\":[\"warcaster\"]},\"featureType\":{\"inclusive\":[\"knack\"]}}']]</p>",
